 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Screenshot: White House/YouTube 🚁 President Trump held a ribbon cutting ceremony today for his renovated White House helipad before leaving for New York and the UN General Assembly. Networks skipped the event amid the broadcast pool suspension, and the president was inaudible on the White House livestream. Go deeper . 📺 Paramount Skydance agreed to a highly anticipated settlement with 12 state attorneys general who sued to block its $110 billion acquisition of Warner Bros. Discovery. The settlement clears the path for the creation of one of the biggest TV and movie behemoths in the world. More from Sara Fischer . ✈️ An equipment outage scrambled flights across the Northeast, forcing ground stops that remained ongoing as of the early afternoon. Go deeper . 
 
